## 🎯 **How to Use the System**

### **For Students:**

#### 1. Apply for Course
- Go to "Courses" page
- Click "Apply Now" on desired course
- Fill application form

#### 2. Upload Registration Fee
- Go to "My Applications"
- Click "Upload Payment" for Registration Fee
- Fill payment details:
  - Payment method
  - Transaction ID
  - Upload payment screenshot/receipt
- Click "Submit Registration Fee"

#### 3. Wait for Admin Approval
- Payment status shows "Pending"
- Admin reviews payment proof
- Admin approves payment

#### 4. Upload Program Fee
- Once registration fee is approved
- Return to "My Applications"
- Click "Upload Payment" for Program Fee
- Submit program fee proof

#### 5. Get Enrolled
- Admin approves program fee
- System sends enrollment email ✅
- Student can access course materials

---

### **For Admins:**

#### 1. View Pending Payments
- Login to admin panel
- Go to "Payments" menu
- See all pending payments with orange badge

#### 2. Review Payment Proof
- Click eye icon to view payment proof
- Verify transaction details
- Check payment screenshot

#### 3. Approve Payment
- Click green checkmark button (✓)
- Confirm approval
- Payment status changes to "Completed"

#### 4. System Automatically:
- Checks if both fees are paid
- Updates application status to "Enrolled"
- Sends enrollment email to student
- Shows success message

#### 5. Reject Payment (if needed)
- Click red X button
- Payment status changes to "Rejected"
- Student can resubmit

